# routes_authz.golden: every route of the Capsule router and the authorization it needs TODAY.
# Generated by `go run ./tools/routeperms` (backend/tools/routeperms); do not edit by hand.
# Columns (tab separated): METHOD, PATH, HANDLER, AUTH, CLASS, OLD_ACTIONS
#   AUTH     public = no authentication middleware; session = middleware.Auth (session or cap_ token)
#   CLASS    action = decided by authz.Service with OLD_ACTIONS; other classes are listed in tools/routeperms/classes.go
#   OLD_ACTIONS  comma separated authz actions the handler checks ('-' when the class is not action)
